      "writtenOn": "2024-08-07T17:30:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wouldn\u0027t they just call `recoverRoutingTable` below?\n\nOr, to make this less prone to developer error, could this API [ActivityManager#registerActivityLifecycleCallbacks](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/app/Activity.java;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1;l\u003d1484?q\u003dActivity.java\u0026sq\u003dgit:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain@main\u0026gsn\u003dregisterActivityLifecycleCallbacks\u0026gs\u003dKYTHE%3A%2F%2Fkythe%3A%2F%2Fgoogleplex-android.googlesource.com%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2Fmain%3Flang%3Djava%3Fpath%3Dandroid.app.Activity%231d3336411541f7e1cb3d06369ba50ae4958233a51c02eccb424f93f9c1fe85e2) so that it can remove the override on behalf of the caller automatically?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 896,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 897,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "851a5bbf5aed6ae0e21607e391e088cce757406e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
