      "message": "Changed to `recoverRoutingTable`. In implementation, a [callback](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/apps/Nfc/src/com/android/nfc/cardemulation/CardEmulationManager.java;l\u003d862;drc\u003dab191a8212855c0c408e120bf4e643925a3ce41a?q\u003dcardemulationmanager\u0026sq\u003dgit:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain@main) is registered when override the routing table to remove the override when the activity moves to background.",
